            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Transport from European production plants to Switzerland. Due to the cumulated data used in the product system inventory of methyl chloride production only selected ressources and emissions are included (according to methodology of Boustead). No land occupation and land use is included in the main production process for methyl chloride. No uncertainity is applied to this preceeding process.;
