        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Assumed that all methyl chloride used in Switzerland origins European production plants. Emission values for storage and handling from chloroform production from a U.S source. For the infrastructure as approximation tank infrastructure for methanol or fuel was used .\n\n# Included processes\nRaw materials, average transport from Production within Europe to Switzerland, emissions to air from tank storage, estimation for storage infrastructure.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
